'''Ep. 2: The Face of Evil''' (第2話 悪の巨顔, ''Dainiwa Aku no Kyogan'', '''Episode 2 The Bighead of Evil''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Overview==
Ep. 2: The Face of Evil contains a total of 10 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards and gauntlet progress reset with every appearance of the event.

